---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Doc title="About PostDelegate" description="PostDelegate is a social media scheduler operated by Nasida Apps LLC: one visual calendar, composer and media library for creators, teams and brands." h1="A clearer home for your social content." eyebrow="About PostDelegate" lead="Plan your content, see what is coming next, and keep the work in one place.">
  <h2>What we are building</h2>
  <p>PostDelegate brings a visual calendar, post composer and media library together for creators, teams and people working across brands. We are rolling out channel connections and integrations during early access.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>Write a post once, tailor it for each channel and schedule it on the calendar. Teams share one workspace, with channels grouped by brand or customer. Every plan starts with a 7-day free trial that needs no credit card.</p>
  <h2>Bring your own AI</h2>
  <p>PostDelegate never charges for AI. AI writing, the Agent and AI images run on your workspace's own OpenAI API key, and a public REST API and MCP server let Claude, ChatGPT, coding agents and your own scripts work with your calendar. See the <a href="/docs">documentation</a> for setup.</p>
  <h2 id="security">Accounts and your content</h2>
  <p>Connect social accounts through the sign-in flow offered for that channel. Do not send your social passwords or access tokens to support or paste them into an AI conversation.</p>
  <p>Read our <a href={SITE.legal.privacy}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={SITE.legal.terms}>terms</a> for the service's data practices and conditions. For account or data requests, <a href="/support#data-requests">contact support</a>.</p>
  <h2>Who runs PostDelegate</h2>
  <p>PostDelegate is operated by {SITE.operator}. For questions, feedback or partnership enquiries, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Doc>
